{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55281","headline":"赠山翁 · 李涛","name":"赠山翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松萝深处住，闲野不生愁。\n鸟语烟岚静，水声门户秋。\n花间归洞路，山下钓鱼舟。\n沐浴圣王化，自怜丝满头。\n（影印本《诗渊》第一册第四九一页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}